Package: pfmatch
Title: Match 990-PF Grant Recipients to the IRS Business Master File
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jdlecy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Recovers recipient EINs for grants reported on Form 990-PF Part XIV
    Table 3a. Standardizes the uncontrolled recipient-status field, resolves the
    two-line recipient name, collapses repeated grant rows to distinct recipient
    identities, and runs a staged, geography-aware blocking cascade against the
    IRS Business Master File. The generic record-linkage machinery -
    normalization, blocking, comparison, hierarchical scoring, vetoes, and
    YES/MAYBE/NO tiering - is provided by 'npmatch'; this package holds only what
    is specific to the 990-PF grant context.
